  "abstract": "Control for the generalization study: Factorized Global MLP + LN without residual copy and without learnable \u03b3. Config: p=32, H=512\u00d72, dr=0.10, Adam lr=9e\u22124, clip=1.0, curvature \u03bb=1e\u22124, 60\u2011min trials. Paired with the Learnable\u2011\u03b3 variant to isolate \u03b3\u2019s effect when RC is removed.",
